---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Richmond Hill Real Estate | Neighbourhood Profile | Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent"
  description="Richmond Hill neighbourhood profile covering housing types, price ranges, transit, schools, and market insights. Oak Ridges Moraine, Yonge Street corridor, and family-oriented communities."
  canonicalPath="/neighbourhoods/richmond-hill"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Richmond Hill</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__subtitle">Neighbourhood Profile</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile Content -->
  <article class="profile">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div class="profile__intro">
        <p>
          Richmond Hill sits between Toronto and Newmarket along the Yonge Street corridor,
          offering a balance of suburban space and urban accessibility that appeals to families,
          move-up buyers, and professionals commuting into the city. Its position along major
          transit and highway routes, combined with strong schools and a diverse community,
          has made it one of York Region's most consistently in-demand markets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Character and Feel -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Character and Feel</h2>
        <p>
          Richmond Hill blends established post-war neighbourhoods in the south with newer
          developments pushing north. The Oak Ridges Moraine forms the northern boundary,
          limiting growth and providing green space, trails, and a natural constraint on housing
          supply that supports long-term property values.
        </p>
        <p>
          The community is diverse, with significant Iranian, Chinese, and South Asian
          populations contributing to a rich cultural fabric, varied dining options, and active
          community life. The Yonge Street corridor serves as the commercial spine, with retail,
          services, and a growing number of mid-rise condo developments.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Who Buys -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Who Buys in Richmond Hill</h2>
        <p>
          Move-up buyers from Toronto and North York represent the largest segment &mdash;
          families seeking detached homes, larger lots, and strong school districts while
          maintaining reasonable commute times. First-time buyers increasingly look at Richmond
          Hill for detached and freehold townhome options that are more accessible than
          equivalent properties in Toronto proper.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Housing Types and Price Ranges -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Housing Types and Price Ranges</h2>
        <ul class="profile__price-list">
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Detached</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$1.2M &ndash; $2.8M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Semi-detached and freehold towns</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$850K &ndash; $1.3M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Condos (near Yonge/GO)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">From $550K</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="profile__price-note">
          The north end of Richmond Hill, closer to the Oak Ridges Moraine, carries a premium
          for larger lots and proximity to green space.
        </p>
        <p class="profile__price-disclaimer">
          These are general estimates based on market activity in early 2026. Actual prices
          vary by property. Speak with Cory for a current assessment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Transit and Highways -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Transit and Highways</h2>
        <p>
          Richmond Hill has strong highway connectivity via the 404/DVP corridor southbound
          into Toronto and Highway 400 to the west. The Barrie GO line provides rail service
          with stops in Richmond Hill, connecting commuters to Union Station. York Region
          Transit (YRT) operates local bus routes, including Viva rapid bus service along
          Yonge Street and Highway 7 corridors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Amenities and Schools -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Amenities and Schools</h2>
        <p>
          Richmond Green Sports Centre and Park is the community's flagship recreational
          facility, offering indoor and outdoor amenities year-round. The Elgin West Community
          Centre provides additional programming. The Oak Ridges Moraine trail system offers
          extensive hiking, cycling, and nature access along the northern boundary.
        </p>
        <p>
          Schools are a significant draw. Richmond Hill High School and Alexander Mackenzie
          High School are well-regarded public high schools. As with other York Region
          communities, school catchment areas directly influence home prices &mdash; properties
          in top-ranked boundaries trade at a premium.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Real Estate Perspective -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Real Estate Perspective</h2>
        <p>
          Richmond Hill's market has remained stable and resilient compared to inner Toronto,
          particularly in the freehold segment. Families continue to prioritize the area for
          its schools, community character, and relative value compared to Toronto detached
          homes. Inventory has grown, giving buyers more options and reducing the urgency that
          characterized 2021&ndash;2022. For sellers, pricing accurately remains critical, but
          well-positioned properties in desirable areas continue to attract strong interest.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="profile__cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Discuss Richmond Hill Real Estate with Cory</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance -->
      <div class="profile__compliance">
        <p>
          Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent. Real estate services provided through Trustwell
          Realty Inc., Brokerage. Information is believed to be accurate but is not guaranteed.
          Speak with Cory for advice specific to your situation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Newsletter -->
  <section class="newsletter">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="newsletter__heading">Stay Informed</h2>
      <p class="newsletter__text">
        Get monthly market data, neighbourhood insights, and practical advice for buyers
        and sellers across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
      <form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter__form" novalidate>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="newsletter-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="newsletter__input"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="newsletter-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  const newsletterForm = document.getElementById('newsletter-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const newsletterStatus = document.getElementById('newsletter-form-status');

  if (newsletterForm && newsletterStatus) {
    newsletterForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      newsletterStatus.textContent = '';
      newsletterStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(newsletterForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'newsletter',
        email: formData.get('email'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          newsletterStatus.textContent = 'You\'re subscribed! Watch your inbox for the next report.';
          newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          newsletterForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        newsletterStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .page-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Profile */
  .profile {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .profile__intro {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__intro p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .profile__section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .profile__section-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Price List */
  .profile__price-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .profile__price-list li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__price-label {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .profile__price-value {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-note {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .profile__price-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .profile__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Compliance */
  .profile__compliance {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__compliance p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .newsletter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter__heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .newsletter__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .newsletter__input {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .newsletter__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .newsletter__btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .newsletter__btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--success {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--error {
    color: #fecaca;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .profile__price-list li {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .profile__price-value {
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .newsletter__form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
